{
    "title": "Wingr: The Social Dating App",
    "description": "Wingr is the FREE social dating app for people who are fed up with miscommunication. Today\u2019s digital-dating world has so many shortcomings, from dry conversations to overly-aggressive hookup requests. With normal dating apps, one of the most crucial pieces of communication is missing... non-verbal communication. Wingr is on a mission to change the dating scene. With our unique \u201cSet the Mood\u201d feature, you can let your match know exactly how you\u2019re feeling at that moment.  \r\n\r\nPlay Matchmaker & Setup Your Friends\r\n\r\nAre you the friend that is always asked to judge dating profiles and search for red flags? Wouldn't it be easier if you could scroll through profiles yourself and tell your friends who would be their best match? \r\n\r\nWith Wingr, you can search profiles for your friends and suggest your favorite profiles. You can do all of this in the app with only your friend knowing you're helping them find matches. It's completely anonymous. To get started have your single friends download the app and invite you to be their Wingr. Create your matchmaker profile and start playing cupid today! \r\n\r\nWHAT SETS WINGR APART FROM OTHER DATING APPS: \r\n\r\nSet the Mood: Wingr\u2019s unique feature allows for you to \u201cSet the Mood\u201d and communicate your mood to your matches subtly. Know exactly what\u2019s on your matches mind when they Set the Mood! \r\n\r\nUse our unique Wingr mode to share profiles with your friends and help them find their perfect match.\r\n\r\nUse Personality Statements to show off your unique personality while also getting a glimpse at a potential matches personality. \r\n\r\nWe\u2019re constantly developing new innovative ideas to help create more meaningful matches on Wingr. Download the app or subscribe to our website to stay informed on what\u2019s coming next! www.wingrdating.com \r\n\r\nLETS\u2019S START MATCHING AND SET THE MOOD!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Wingr is the FREE social dating app for people who are fed up with miscommunication. Today\u2019s digital-dating world has so many shortcomings, from dry conversations to overly-aggressive hookup requests. With normal dating apps, one of the most crucial pieces of communication is missing... non-verbal communication. Wingr is on a mission to change the dating scene. With our unique \u201cSet the Mood\u201d feature, you can let your match know exactly how you\u2019re feeling at that moment.  <br><br>Play Matchmaker &amp; Setup Your Friends<br><br>Are you the friend that is always asked to judge dating profiles and search for red flags? Wouldn&#39;t it be easier if you could scroll through profiles yourself and tell your friends who would be their best match? <br><br>With Wingr, you can search profiles for your friends and suggest your favorite profiles. You can do all of this in the app with only your friend knowing you&#39;re helping them find matches. It&#39;s completely anonymous. To get started have your single friends download the app and invite you to be their Wingr. Create your matchmaker profile and start playing cupid today! <br><br>WHAT SETS WINGR APART FROM OTHER DATING APPS: <br><br>Set the Mood: Wingr\u2019s unique feature allows for you to \u201cSet the Mood\u201d and communicate your mood to your matches subtly. Know exactly what\u2019s on your matches mind when they Set the Mood! <br><br>Use our unique Wingr mode to share profiles with your friends and help them find their perfect match.<br><br>Use Personality Statements to show off your unique personality while also getting a glimpse at a potential matches personality. <br><br>We\u2019re constantly developing new innovative ideas to help create more meaningful matches on Wingr. Download the app or subscribe to our website to stay informed on what\u2019s coming next! www.wingrdating.com <br><br>LETS\u2019S START MATCHING AND SET THE MOOD!",
